INSERT INTO game_translations (game_id, language_code, title, description) SELECT id, 'en', 'Monsterseed', 'Monster Seed obviously takes influence from the popular animal raising/fighting genre; specifically games like Pokémon and Monster Rancher. Of course, it does do a few things differently. One major difference is the fantasy setting. No ranches or medical settings here, no sir. Another key difference is in the overall presentation; Monster Seed''s gameplay and interface are a lot more simple than most other breeding games.
